MaXXXine, a third film in the series and a direct
sequel to X, was released on July 5, 2024.

21
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
Goth reprised her other role from the first film.

22
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The film explores themes of farm, pornography,
dance performance, confession, texas.

23
01:37:45,000 --> 01:37:51,000
The tone is lighthearted and dark and intense.
